  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Name of project: PULSE-Music Matters. Music matters because it has an unique way of teaching us how to be together in different and better ways. The PULSE 3 Project between the Norwegian Band Federation and the Field Band Federation will generate new teaching and learning methods that enhance integrated health and lifeskills thorugh music activities, which is so important for young people in all parts of the world. Inclusive communities are built on strong civil society voices, nurtured by their creative commitment to share and listen. &quot;Music Matters -PULSE 3&quot; will amplify the value of this respectful and innovative partnership, that contributes to the sustainable global culture.</narrative>
  </description>
